This work is created by William D. Colburn for his own personal use.

Geste is, according to Google, an Old French word meaning a heroic deed,
a historical account, or a family lineage.  It comes from the Latin word
gesta meaning actions accomplished or exploits.  All of this leads back
to the Chanson de Gesta.  It feels like a good name for a campaign
world.

  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chanson_de_geste

============================================================

The updates/ directory is intended to contain long-form prose of my
thoughts as I work on this.  Formated as yyyy-mm-dd-nnn to make sorting
easier.  Normally formatted prose is acceptable in updates.

The maps/ directory is for all maps created.  There should be the main
continent level .wxx and .png files (Worldographer), as well as other
maps that need to get made.

